cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it."
title: "QuPath_Rust"
abstract: >-
  An accelerated Rust implementation of QuPath's watershed cell detection,
  reproducing its logic with a columnar object layout. Behaviour is checked
  against output recorded from QuPath itself. Known divergences from QuPath,
  including an open density-dependent count difference, are recorded in
  DIVERGENCES.md and should be read before relying on its output.
authors:
  - name: "Dante-Berth"
    alias: Dante-Berth
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-7566-1979"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dante-Berth/QuPath_Rust"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
type: software
keywords:
  - digital pathology
  - whole-slide imaging
  - cell detection
  - QuPath
  - Rust
